#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`{all?, http?, https?}` — `'proxyValue` is `string` (URL) or "
"`proxyConfig` per slot"
msgstr ""
"`{all?, http?, https?}` — `'proxyValue` はスロットごとに `string` (URL) または "
"`proxyConfig` のいずれか"

#: ../../user/plugin-http.md:9
msgid "`proxyConfig`"
msgstr "`proxyConfig`"

